        "description": "<p>Securely manage your checkout options by forcing Cash on Delivery for specific product categories. Perfect for stores handling heavy items or local deliveries.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Edit a Product Category to enable &#8220;Force COD Only&#8221;.</li>\n</ol>\n",
